# Container-image findings the Security workflow must not block on — one advisory id per line, with
# the reason above it. Trivy reads this file from the repo root without being pointed at it.
#
# The image job already passes --ignore-unfixed, so anything listed here is a vulnerability that
# *has* a fix we are choosing not to take yet. Say why, and put an expiry on it.
#
# Base image lags the advisory; the CLI it affects is not installed in the runtime stage.
# CVE-0000-00000 exp:2026-12-31
